                "Key Climatic Types: Af (Tropical Rainforest / Selvas), Aw (Tropical Savanna / Wet & Dry), Am (Tropical Monsoon), Cs (Mediterranean / dry summer), Cfb (Marine West Coast), and ET (Tundra).",
